{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>早前因社交平台退追風波引發不和傳聞的張敬軒與王菀之，昨晚（25日）終於首度合體開直播粉碎謠言。兩人齊齊病倒卻依然應網民要求即席獻唱，展現神級唱功。兩位樂壇好友在互動期間突然宣布的一項全新計劃更令大批歌迷陷入瘋狂。</p>\n<h2>張敬軒王菀之抱恙開直播合唱王菲金曲</h2>\n<p>昨晚這場原本只為敘舊網上直播吸引近萬名觀眾同時在線圍觀。張敬軒聲帶發炎加上王菀之氣管發炎，二人索性自封「上呼吸道發炎組合」，並應歌迷要求深情合唱王菲經典金曲《季候風》。張敬軒一度提議唱《相思風雨中》卻被網民取笑似參加中年歌唱比賽，兩人互窒場面非常惹笑。</p>\n<h2>王菀之西九開騷即場逼供男方承諾現身</h2>\n<p>王菀之在直播期間落力宣傳今年12月4日至13日於西九文化區舉行的《話・說》藝術展音樂會，更突然開腔質問張敬軒會否出席。面對突如其來「逼供」，張敬軒罕有沉默數秒，即被女方以新歌《YES BUT NO》歌名反擊。張敬軒連忙解釋正忙於排練演唱會，但最終依然在直播尾聲化身宣傳大使，承諾到時必定現身支持好友。</p>\n<h2>相隔近廿載再出國語碟全因蘇打綠一句話</h2>\n<p>除了年底音樂會，王菀之更帶來正籌備第二張國語專輯驚喜消息。她透露今年2月與蘇打綠在香港同台演出時，獲對方在台上鼓勵出碟，因而促成這次相隔近20年回歸國語樂壇大計。早前她遠赴冰島參與音樂會圓夢，卻因當地極度嚴寒天氣凍到雙手發紫兼冷親氣管，加上近期工作繁忙導致睡眠質素變差，令身體響起警號。</p>\n<h2>粉絲激讚病友組合聲沙依然好聽兼求開騷</h2>\n<p>兩人破冰合體開Live瞬間成為網絡熱話，大批網民紛紛湧入留言區表達興奮之情。不少網民聽完《季候風》後留言大讚兩人「即使聲沙沙和音與唱功依然好聽到令人起雞皮」，認為神級實力不受病情影響。更有大批歌迷瘋狂刷屏點唱王菲其他作品，連張敬軒也直認好想與女方舉辦一場全晚只唱王菲歌曲限定音樂會。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568501417664210_15879441566b07fa96c36a3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"螢幕擷取畫面 2026-11-26 170306.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568501417664210_15879441566b07fa96c36a3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568501707840769_848630966b07fa99ec3ab.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"話說_Making of_1.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568501707840769_848630966b07fa99ec3ab.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ab_138580918367bc4773c47c9-1024x1281.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"王菀之 （圖片來源：官方提供）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/ab_138580918367bc4773c47c9-1024x1281.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：官方提供）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568502061444116_2820029686b07fa9d3793a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-26 at 2.20.16 AM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568502061444116_2820029686b07fa9d3793a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568502350547265_2106389836b07fa9fe1f00.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-26 at 2.20.15 AM (3).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179568502350547265_2106389836b07fa9fe1f00.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956850255171888_726956266b07faa1da961.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"WhatsApp Image 2026-11-26 at 2.20.15 AM (2).jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17956850255171888_726956266b07faa1da961.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T09:43:54.686985+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1030,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:23:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:20.642876+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:37:20.642876+00:00","content_hash":"3e7663541789b8545c44a2ca1bdcf2e2d8a72ee3d771123f4159bf5e4df2b756","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}